==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|засты́ть|-вать}} or from {{af|ru|засты́нуть|-ва́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|застыва́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-застывать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|застыва́ть|impf|pf=засты́ть,засты́нуть}}

# to [[thicken]], to [[harden]], to [[solidify]]
# to [[cool down]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[freeze]], to feel cold; to [[catch cold]]
# to [[stiffen]], to [[freeze]], to be / become / stand stockstill

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|1a|застыва́ть}}

